WEBVTT

00:07:28.760 --> 00:07:30.456
And so during my sabbatical

00:07:30.480 --> 00:07:33.056
with the organization
that I also work with,

00:07:33.080 --> 00:07:36.296
I saw our team rise up in my absence.

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:38.776
They were able to launch new programs,

00:07:38.800 --> 00:07:40.216
fundraise.

00:07:40.240 --> 00:07:41.936
And when I came back,

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:46.016
I had to give them
a lot of gratitude and praise

00:07:46.040 --> 00:07:49.776
because they showed me
that they truly had my back

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:52.696
and that they truly had their own backs.

00:07:52.720 --> 00:07:55.336
You know, in this process
of my sabbatical,

00:07:55.360 --> 00:07:56.616
I was really reminded

00:07:56.640 --> 00:08:01.576
of this Southern African
philosophy of Ubuntu.